e world.</p>\n<p>So we have this unholy triumvirate, forged in the lowest level of Hell, where they each think they're going to use the others to destroy what remains of the West and take it over for themselves.</p>\n<p>They are also holding terrible threats over every person in the West: water supplies and power supplies taken down, and massive wildfires started in the hills above the cities, just for a start.</p>\n<p>Those threats are why &quot;nothing ever happens.&quot;</p>\n<p>God help us all.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}